       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. V01-CALL-LOOP-STATIC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-I        PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-RESULT   PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 3
               CALL "V01COUNT" USING BY REFERENCE WS-RESULT
               DISPLAY "ITER=" WS-I " RESULT=" WS-RESULT
           END-PERFORM.
           STOP RUN.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. V01COUNT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-COUNT    PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-RESULT   PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-RESULT.
       COUNT-PARA.
           ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT.
           MOVE WS-COUNT TO LK-RESULT.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM V01COUNT.
       END PROGRAM V01-CALL-LOOP-STATIC.
